Package: zebra-rs
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: sonicproject <sonicproject@googlegroups.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://zebra.rs/
Description: zebra-rs routing stack for SONiC
 BGP, OSPF and IS-IS in one memory-safe Rust daemon, replacing the FRR
 control plane. Routes are teed to SONiC's Forwarding Plane Manager
 (fpmsyncd) in addition to the kernel, so APPL_DB, orchagent, syncd and
 SAI are unchanged.
 .
 Ships the daemon, the vtyctl CLI client and the YANG schemas the daemon
 loads at startup.
